what's your motivation it's important to  understand the motivation behind every  action that you take as an entrepreneur  because there's going to be one or two  things one you're doing it because you  really love to do it and it's the right  thing to do and the other reason too is  because  you think it's going to help your  business and make some money  and sometimes they work together but a  lot of times they don't and here's the  challenge okay the challenge is giving  up on things that  you think will make a lot of money you  think could work for you but you don't  enjoy because if you can't give yourself  fully to a task fully to a project fully  to an idea it's not going to work it can  work for other people but it's not going  to work for you and that takes a lot of  courage and guts to give up on those  projects that you see working for  everybody else  but it will not work for you let me give  you an example i look at my use of  twitter and twitter i love twitter i  love twitter it's a way to connect with  people i share  my videos i share quotes i share  pictures i share what's happening in my  life i love twitter and i love  interacting with you guys  and i came up with an idea hey what if i  made a twitter list of all the media who  are covering entrepreneurship the big  media  and i read their articles and i comment  on it and i tweet on it  and so i built this list  and  and i started following them and i  started responding to them and what they  were posting  and after a few days it started to feel  like a chore  it started to feel like a chore this  wasn't something i enjoyed doing and i  thought wow this this could be a great  idea you know my end goal was to be in  the media more so i was hoping that if  somebody you know saw my tweets enough  and i was leaving insightful comments  they would write to me and i would be an  expert on one of their columns and that  works that works for a lot of people  the problem is i didn't enjoy doing it  if you're the person who reads an  article and you look at it and say wow  that is so great i have to leave a  comment on i have to let everybody know  about it or you read an article and  you're like that was terrible this is so  wrong i need to leave a comment and say  why  then that's a good strategy for you i'm  not that guy  i don't enjoy doing that stuff so i had  to kill the strategy even though  it works for other people this isn't an  easy thing it's a constant daily  struggle because we're all trying to  think hey how do we grow our businesses  what can i do today to grow my business  today right i want to make some more  money i want to bring in you know more  people i want to have a greater impact  what can i do today to make that happen  and we look for easy solutions and we  look for things that work for other  people  we look for shortcuts you know we look  for ways to make it happen right now i  get it you're impatient right i'm  impatient too i want to hit my billing  entrepreneur goal as soon as possible  but the way that it's going to happen is  by doing things that you love and you  can pour yourself into you can give  yourself fully to  so one of the things that i do on  twitter and on on youtube is i respond  to everybody  right you leave a comment on my video or  you tweet me back unless you're spamming  me or bothering me i'm gonna respond to  you  and that takes time that takes time  every day  to do and i could give that as a  strategy to say hey here's what you need  to do you need to respond to everybody  who writes in the challenge is  you may not enjoy that  you know i  love you guys i love the youtube  community i love my twitter community  it's honestly one of the best parts of  my day i wake up i eat my lentils for  breakfast and i look at your comments  and i just start responding and it may  not be an in-depth comment i may just  leave a happy face whatever it is but i  am responding to people and i love doing  that so i need to keep doing it and i  need to have faith  i need to believe  that by doing that it's going to help my  business grow  and it has  it has grown i've gotten tons of  opportunities that have come from my  youtube channel and that's because you  guys watch and you guys share and you  guys leave comments  so you have to look at everything you're  doing with your business every task that  you're doing and you have to understand  is this something  that needs to be done and if it is  is it you who needs to do it  because you can always automate it you  can delegate it you can  eliminate it if it's not helpful  but you need to make sure that your time  is being spent on things that you love  doing things that you can pour yourself  into things that you can get lost in  things that you feel like you're in the  flow things that you look at the clock  at nine in the morning and suddenly at  six at night and you don't know where  the time went because you're so invested  in what you're doing that's what you  need to be spending your time on not the  things where you look at your calendar  of all the things you need to do like oh  i hate everything on my list  if you're that entrepreneur if you hate  everything that you have to do today  you're not going to achieve massive  success with your business it's not  going to happen because you're doing  things that you hate how can you have  great success when you're doing things  that you hate  so look at your schedule look at your  tasks look at what you have to do today  this week this month  and really examine it  are you doing these things because it's  the right thing to do because you love  it because you're fully invested in it  or are you doing it because you think  it's going to help grow your business  but deep down inside you really hate it  take a hard look  and start making some changes  believe for those of you watching like  the video  give a thumbs up below leave a comment  you know how much it means to me leave a  comment be